摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"CloserAI - a local-first, model-agnostic, permission-transparent desktop AI workbench built on DeepSeek Harness.","id":"gh:1333770983","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DSH-closerAI","slug":"sb1733831438-maker/DSH-closerAI","topics":["agent-harness","ai-agent","ai-workbench","cordis","deepseek-harness","desktop-ai","desktop-app","dsh","dsh-plugin","electron","installer","local-first","mcp","model-agnostic","multi-model","nsis","open-source","react","typescript","windows"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"CloserAI - a local-first, model-agnostic, permission-transparent desktop AI workbench built on DeepS"},{"id":"p1s2","text":" local-first, model-agnostic, permission-transparent desktop AI workbench built on DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# CloserAI"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> Local-first, model-agnostic, permission-transparent desktop AI workbench for\n> real Chat + Work + "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"Code/Cowork outcomes. **Built on DeepSeek Harness.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"CloserAI is an open-source desktop client that hosts a DeepSeek Harness\nprocess inside a hardened El"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ectron shell. It is **not a thin wrapper**: it keeps DSH as the agent runtime\nand adds a desktop sup"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ervisor, three permission-isolated working modes, local-first session storage,\nOS-keychain secrets, "},{"id":"p5s4","text":"and a plugin security model."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## ✨ What you get"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Hardened shell** — context isolation, sandbox, strict CSP, locked-down navigation, single instan"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ce, deep links.\n- **Three permission-isolated modes** — Chat / Work / Code, so the model only gets e"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"xactly the tools and files it should.\n- **Local-first sessions** — every conversation is persisted u"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"nder `DSH_HOME`, with history, projects, export/import, and restart recovery.\n- **Native desktop** —"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" system tray, crash/recovery notifications, launch at login.\n- **Transparent by design** — a managem"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ent page shows capability toggles, a per-mode permission manifest, and redacted diagnostics.\n- **Mod"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"el-agnostic** — DeepSeek, any OpenAI-compatible endpoint, or fully-offline **Mock mode** (no API key"},{"id":"p7s8","text":" needed).\n- **System DSH sync** — when a system DSH home (`~/.dsh`) exists, the desktop boots your o"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"wn DSH: same sessions, plugins and settings as your web DSH (and never overwrites its config).\n- **O"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"fficial DeepSeek orca icon** — the app, installer and taskbar use the official DeepSeek whale logo.\n"},{"id":"p7s11","text":"- **Sync experience** — a “已与系统 DSH 同步” banner in the workspace page, and a friendly hint when the s"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"hared home is locked by another DSH instead of a silent crash.\n- **Auto-update** — built-in updater "},{"id":"p7s13","text":"(electron-updater + GitHub Releases); check for updates from the workspace page.\n- **Cross-platform "},{"id":"p7s14","text":"installers** — Windows (NSIS), macOS (dmg, arm64), and Linux (AppImage) built in CI with per-platfor"},{"id":"p7s15","text":"m auto-update metadata.\n- **Supply-chain transparency** — a CycloneDX SBOM (973 components, license-"},{"id":"p7s16","text":"gated in `pnpm check`) is generated and shipped with every release.\n- **MCP server management** — ma"},{"id":"p7s17","text":"nage reusable MCP servers (stdio / HTTP) from the workspace page, export a standard `mcp.json` for C"},{"id":"p7s18","text":"laude Code, Kimi Code, editors, or any MCP-compatible client, and **mount enabled servers into the r"},{"id":"p7s19","text":"unning DSH** (tools appear as `mcp__<server>__<tool>`) with credentials injected through the child e"},{"id":"p7s20","text":"* (tools appear as `mcp__<server>__<tool>`) with credentials injected through the child environment."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"**Option A — install the Windows build (recommended)**"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Download the latest installer: **Windows** `CloserAI-0.8.0-Setup-x64.exe`, **macOS** `CloserAI-0."},{"id":"p10s2","text":"8.0-arm64.dmg`, or **Linux** `CloserAI-0.8.0.AppImage` — all on the Releases page.\n2. Verify the SHA"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"-256 against `SHA256SUMS.txt` (Windows: `Get-FileHash -Algorithm SHA256 .\\CloserAI-0.8.0-Setup-x64.e"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"xe`).\n3. Run the installer, then launch CloserAI and pick **Mock mode** to try it with zero configur"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"3. Run the installer, then launch CloserAI and pick **Mock mode** to try it with zero configuration."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> The installer is not code-signed yet — if SmartScreen warns, choose _More info → Run anyway_,\n> an"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"d rely on the checksum. See docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**Option B — run from source**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Requires Node.js >= 20.19 and pnpm 11. DSH is pinned to the exact runtime version in the lockfile."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## 🧩 Modes"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Mode     | Can do                                                          | Cannot do            "},{"id":"p16s2","text":"                                    |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| **Chat** | Web search, attachments (read-only)                             | Shell, local file acc"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"ess                                 |\n| **Work** | Document processing in an app-private sandbox    "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"               | Shell, access outside the sandbox                        |\n| **Code** | Your chosen"},{"id":"p17s4","text":" directory, shell/git/terminal with approval prompts | Anything outside the approved directory witho"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"hell/git/terminal with approval prompts | Anything outside the approved directory without approval |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Switch modes from the tray or the management page; each project pins a mode + working directory and "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"is restored on relaunch."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## 🛠 Development"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"New features must keep `pnpm check` green (187 tests) and `pnpm smoke` passing. See\ndocs/PLUGIN_DEV."},{"id":"p21s2","text":"md for extending modes/presets."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## 📚 Documentation"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- User manual (EN) · 用户手册 (中文)\n- Troubleshooting\n- Architecture · Decisions · Status · Execution pla"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"n\n- Third-party notices · Security policy · Contributing"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## 🗺 Milestones"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Version    | Scope                                                                     | Status   "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ion    | Scope                                                                     | Status        |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| v0.0.1     | Monorepo, tooling, mock provider, CI                                      | Released "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"     |\n| v0.0.2     | Desktop shell: DSH supervisor + hardened Electron window                  | Re"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"leased      |\n| v0.0.3     | Onboarding, keychain secrets, DeepSeek/OpenAI-compatible + mock provide"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"rs | Released      |\n| v0.0.4     | Chat / Work / Code permission-isolated profiles                 "},{"id":"p26s5","text":"          | Released      |\n| v0.0.5     | Daily conversation: sessions, history, projects, file han"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"dling            | Released      |\n| v0.0.6     | Extensions & Web: capability toggles, diagnostics,"},{"id":"p26s7","text":" permission manifest    | Released      |\n| v0.0.7     | Native desktop: tray, notifications, launch"},{"id":"p26s8","text":"-at-login                      | Released      |\n| v0.0.8     | First Windows installer + packaged D"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"SH runtime fix                        | Released      |\n| v0.0.9     | RC hardening: notices, securi"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"ty & robustness suites, manuals              | Released      |\n| **v0.1.0** | **Daily-use release: W"},{"id":"p26s11","text":"indows installer + checksum**                       | **Released**  |\n| v0.2.0     | System DSH home"},{"id":"p26s12","text":" sync: desktop == your web DSH                             | Released      |\n| v0.2.1     | Official"},{"id":"p26s13","text":" DeepSeek orca app icon                                           | Released      |\n| v0.3.0     | S"},{"id":"p26s14","text":"ync experience: workspace banner + friendly concurrent-DSH handling      | Released      |\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
